cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "vcgsuite: A Python library for ECG/VCG signal processing"
authors:
  - family-names: Kuon
    given-names: Felix
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-16
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FelixKuon/vcgsuite"
abstract: >
  vcgsuite converts 12-lead and EASI ECG recordings into vectorcardiograms
  (VCG), detects R-peaks, derives respiration from ECG (EDR), annotates beat
  landmarks using a Frenet-Serret geometry approach on the 3D VCG trajectory,
  extracts P/QRS/T loop features, and computes HRV metrics.
